      <data key="d13">["label: Label values, such as 0s and 1s, 0 represent for good", "pred: Predicted probability or score.", "title: Title of plot, default is \"performance\".", "groupnum: The group number when calculating KS.  Default NULL,", "plot_type: Types of performance plot, such as \"ks\", \"lift\", \"roc\", \"pr\".", "show_plot: Logical value, default is TRUE. It means whether to show plot.", "positive: Value of positive class, default is \"bad|1\".", "seed: Integer, default is 186. The specify seed is used for random sorting data."]</data>
